    <!-- TL;DR Section -->
    <section id="tldr">
      <h2>TL;DR</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>HL7 is a legacy healthcare messaging standard; FHIR is a modern, web native, API framework.</li>
        <li>Many jobs ask for FHIR knowledge, but understanding HL7 gives you an edge.</li>
        <li>Programming skills in Python, JSON, and JavaScript help you translate and build between both systems.</li>
        <li>This post explains where HL7 and FHIR overlap, how to map between them, and why bridging them makes you
          uniquely valuable in health tech.</li>
      </ul>
